+    "prompt": "Use case: photorealistic-natural. Production raster decor asset for Seared Vegas. Generate at the largest available size for the requested orientation. Flat scan, no perspective. No text, letters, numbers, logos, watermark, people, hands, food, utensils, frames, grid lines, or drop shadows. Output one image, no contact sheet. SQUARE. Tileable texture: flat top-down scan of aged cream butcher paper. Warm cream base averaging #f0dfbb, subtle long paper fibres, very faint mottled tea-stain blotches in slightly darker tan (#e2c896), a sparse sprinkle of tiny dark grit specks. No folds, creases, tears, burn marks, grease rings, vignette, lighting gradient or shadows. Contrast must stay LOW because black display type sits on it. Uniform all over, edge to edge, no feature that would be noticed when the image repeats. No visible sheet edges or borders. COLOUR CORRECTION IS CRITICAL: the average must be RGB(240,223,187), hex #f0dfbb, a PALE LIGHT CREAM, not yellow parchment, gold, ochre or brown. Almost all pixels should stay very close to this light cream. The faint fibre details must differ only slightly from base. Tea blotches extremely faint and sparse. Only rare tiny grit dots may be darker. Use #f0dfbb as a flat base over the ENTIRE canvas.",
